<view class="page" wx:if="{{book}}"><view class="title">把故事读一遍</view><view class="sub">文字和画面都可以改，满意了再开始画。</view><view wx:if="{{book.source === 'structured'}}" class="notice">这是按你原文拆分的初稿，还没有经过 AI 整理。请逐页调整重复或过长的文字；事实少时，可以选短一点的书。</view><view class="label">小书的名字</view><input value="{{book.title}}" data-field="title" bindinput="edit" maxlength="80" disabled="{{busy || book.status !== 'draft'}}"/><view class="segments"><button wx:for="{{counts}}" wx:key="*this" data-count="{{item}}" bindtap="count" class="{{book.count === item ? 'selected' : ''}}" disabled="{{busy || book.status !== 'draft'}}">{{item}} 页</button></view><view class="tiny center">封面计入页数 · {{benefit}}</view><view wx:for="{{book.pages}}" wx:key="index" class="page-card"><view class="small">{{index === 0 ? '封面' : '第 ' + (index+1) + ' 页'}}</view><textarea value="{{item.text}}" data-field="text" data-index="{{index}}" bindinput="edit" maxlength="240" disabled="{{busy || book.status !== 'draft'}}"/><view class="tiny">这一页的画面</view><textarea class="scene" value="{{item.scene}}" data-field="scene" data-index="{{index}}" bindinput="edit" maxlength="500" disabled="{{busy || book.status !== 'draft'}}"/></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="notice error">{{error}}</view><button class="primary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="submit">{{cta}}</button><button wx:if="{{book.status === 'checkout'}}" class="text-button" bindtap="cancel">取消待付款订单，继续修改</button><view class="tiny center">开始后逐页绘画，小书会自动保存在你的书架。<br/>重画先看新画面，再决定是否替换。</view></view><view wx:else class="page"><view class="loading">正在打开小故事…</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="notice error">{{error}}</view></view>